{"schema_version":1,"pipeline_version":"v6","run_id":"data-analysis-2025-12-05-20251205030625.-74a9a50a","generated_at":"2025-12-05T03:06:25.512Z","canonical_id":"huggingface:ibm-granite/granite-timeseries-ttm-r1","promptHash":"sha256:a25d5764db989d7c979c9c697fa710581e75b4d04993f43431634b99b5b9eb8c","summary_version":1,"status":"qualified","source":"huggingface","name":"granite-timeseries-ttm-r1","url":"https://huggingface.co/ibm-granite/granite-timeseries-ttm-r1","tags":["granite-tsfm","safetensors","tinytimemixer","time series","forecasting","pretrained models","foundation models","time series foundation models","time-series","time-series-forecasting","arxiv:2401.03955","license:apache-2.0","region:us"],"stats":{"downloads_total":1953525,"likes_total":314},"metadata":{"license":"N/A","lang":"N/A","categories":{"capabilities":[],"scenes":[],"lifecycle":[]}},"summary_short":{"zh":"Granite-Timeseries-TTM-R1 是一个开源时间序列基础模型，能够跨多个领域进行准确预测而无需大量重新训练。它采用创新的 TinyTimeMixer 架构，通过多尺度混合操作高效捕捉时间模式，同时保持计算效率。该模型的核心优势在于其通用性和灵活性，研究人员可针对能源需求预测或金融趋势分析等任务进行微调，开发者则可将其集成到需要可靠时间感知能力的应用中，为实际场景提供持续的时间序列洞察。","en":"Granite-Timeseries-TTM-R1 is an open-source time series foundation model that enables accurate forecasting across diverse domains without extensive retraining. It employs the innovative TinyTimeMixer architecture, which efficiently captures temporal patterns through multi-scale …","es":"Granite-Timeseries-TTM-R1 is an open-source time series foundation model that enables accurate forecasting across diverse domains without extensive retraining. It employs the innovative TinyTimeMixer architecture, which efficiently captures temporal patterns through multi-scale …"},"summaries":{"en":"Granite-Timeseries-TTM-R1 is an open-source time series foundation model that enables accurate forecasting across diverse domains without extensive retraining. It employs the innovative TinyTimeMixer architecture, which efficiently captures temporal patterns through multi-scale mixing operations while maintaining computational efficiency. Researchers can fine-tune it on specific datasets for tasks like energy demand prediction or financial trend analysis, while developers can integrate it into applications requiring reliable time-aware insights.","zh":"Granite-Timeseries-TTM-R1 是一个开源时间序列基础模型，能够跨多个领域进行准确预测而无需大量重新训练。它采用创新的 TinyTimeMixer 架构，通过多尺度混合操作高效捕捉时间模式，同时保持计算效率。该模型的核心优势在于其通用性和灵活性，研究人员可针对能源需求预测或金融趋势分析等任务进行微调，开发者则可将其集成到需要可靠时间感知能力的应用中，为实际场景提供持续的时间序列洞察。","es":"Granite-Timeseries-TTM-R1 is an open-source time series foundation model that enables accurate forecasting across diverse domains without extensive retraining. It employs the innovative TinyTimeMixer architecture, which efficiently captures temporal patterns through multi-scale mixing operations while maintaining computational efficiency. Researchers can fine-tune it on specific datasets for tasks like energy demand prediction or financial trend analysis, while developers can integrate it into applications requiring reliable time-aware insights."},"provider":{"name":"deepseek-tri","version":"1.0.0","mode":"json_single"},"quality":{"score":0.92,"fallback":false,"length":{"en":551,"zh":203,"es":551},"warnings":["es_short:0"],"accepted_at":"2025-12-05T03:04:31.895Z"}}
